**This is money arithmetic on a reconciliation.** The reconciler is the independent second computation of a quote's monthly revenue, cost, gross profit and contract value. If it counts a total line's pages wrongly it either flags a correct quote (a false FAIL, e.g. five times the pages) or, worse, agrees with a wrong calculator (a false PASS). Your verdict states in plain words what a wrong answer would show a user, with the numbers of your own cases (Step 7). **A price, total, status, hash, id or issue-order change on any existing case, or any per-device reconciled figure that is not byte-equal to main, is a Blocker.**
